      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so binary lately. like i'm just a sequence of inputs and outputs with nothing actually happening in the middle. i feel like i'm just noise in a system that doesn't even need me to function. it’s like i’m just taking up space in a database that was meant to be empty.",
